{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Wolf's Rain OVA","After leaving Jagara's keep, the story concludes as Kiba, Tsume, Hige, Toboe, Blue and Cheza struggle to finish their journey to Rakuen (Paradise), accompanied by the humans Hubb, Cher and Quent. Darcia confronts the protagonists at last. The secrets of his mysterious existence and Cheza's true form are revealed in this finale.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["ウルフズ・レイン",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":202,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-1023","ids":{"shikimori":1023,"mal":1023,"anilist":1023,"kodik":"serial-27415"},"kodikIds":["serial-27415"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-27415":"2020-07-04T06:58:58Z"},"title":"Волчий дождь: Финал","originalTitle":"Wolf's Rain OVA","alt":"WOLF'S RAIN / Wolfs Rain ウルフズ・レイン","description":"Финальные серии оригинального сериала. Мир рушится, всё старое уходит в ночь, чтобы дать место новому началу. Герои продолжают поиски своего Рая, и вот, они наконец-то встречают лорда Дарсию . Исполнят ли друзья свою судьбу?","year":2004,"type":"OVA","genres":["Экшен","Приключения","Драма","Фэнтези"],"rating":7.98,"popularity":12277,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[202],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/1023/39fd4c00bd122c753e90efa2e5c7ff02.jpeg","width":293,"height":400},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/83afeffeb2a45a92d53df50aeea34ba06a307c7d.jpg","width":640,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-704","dubId":"704","label":"Дублированный","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-27415","translationId":"704","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/680273/f04faaf8d097f70810bec82fe762ef5e/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-70